{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 34,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 580.427,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.319,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that after Alma had spoken these words unto them",
      "verse": "34:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 4.499,
      "end": 6.31,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he sat down upon the ground,",
      "verse": "34:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 6.49,
      "end": 10.53,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and Amulek arose and began to teach them, saying:",
      "verse": "34:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 11.21,
      "end": 12.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "My brethren,",
      "verse": "34:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 12.597,
      "end": 20.817,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I think that it is impossible that ye should be ignorant of the things which have been spoken concerning the coming of Christ,",
      "verse": "34:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 20.997,
      "end": 23.644,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who is taught by us to be the Son of God;",
      "verse": "34:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 23.824,
      "end": 30.558,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, I know that these things were taught unto you bountifully before your dissension from among us.",
      "verse": "34:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 31.238,
      "end": 35.882,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And as ye have desired of my beloved brother that he should make known unto you",
      "verse": "34:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 36.062,
      "end": 39.173,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "what ye should do, because of your afflictions;",
      "verse": "34:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 39.353,
      "end": 42.836,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he hath spoken somewhat unto you to prepare your minds;",
      "verse": "34:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 43.016,
      "end": 46.824,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and he hath exhorted you unto faith and to patience\u2014",
      "verse": "34:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 47.504,
      "end": 50.058,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, even that ye would have so much faith",
      "verse": "34:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 50.238,
      "end": 52.699,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as even to plant the word in your hearts,",
      "verse": "34:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 52.879,
      "end": 55.99,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may try the experiment of its goodness.",
      "verse": "34:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 56.67,
      "end": 61.686,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And we have beheld that the great question which is in your minds",
      "verse": "34:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 61.866,
      "end": 64.513,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "is whether the word be in the Son of God,",
      "verse": "34:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 64.693,
      "end": 66.922,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or whether there shall be no Christ.",
      "verse": "34:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 67.602,
      "end": 72.2,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And ye also beheld that my brother has proved unto you, in many instances,",
      "verse": "34:6",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 72.38,
      "end": 74.981,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the word is in Christ unto salvation.",
      "verse": "34:6",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 75.661,
      "end": 78.819,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "My brother has called upon the words of Zenos,",
      "verse": "34:7",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 78.999,
      "end": 84.061,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that redemption cometh through the Son of God, and also upon the words of Zenock;",
      "verse": "34:7",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 84.241,
      "end": 88.885,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also he has appealed unto Moses, to prove that these things are true.",
      "verse": "34:7",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 89.565,
      "end": 94.488,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, behold, I will testify unto you of myself that these things are true.",
      "verse": "34:8",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 94.668,
      "end": 102.702,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I say unto you, that I do know that Christ shall come among the children of men, to take upon him the transgressions of his people,",
      "verse": "34:8",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 102.882,
      "end": 105.483,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that he shall atone for the sins of the world;",
      "verse": "34:8",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 105.663,
      "end": 107.846,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the Lord God hath spoken it.",
      "verse": "34:8",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 108.526,
      "end": 111.684,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For it is expedient that an atonement should be made;",
      "verse": "34:9",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 111.864,
      "end": 114.836,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for according to the great plan of the Eternal God",
      "verse": "34:9",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 115.016,
      "end": 117.059,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there must be an atonement made",
      "verse": "34:9",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 117.239,
      "end": 120.211,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or else all mankind must unavoidably perish;",
      "verse": "34:9",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 120.391,
      "end": 122.109,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, all are hardened;",
      "verse": "34:9",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 122.289,
      "end": 125.679,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, all are fallen and are lost, and must perish",
      "verse": "34:9",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 125.859,
      "end": 130.224,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except it be through the atonement which it is expedient should be made.",
      "verse": "34:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 130.904,
      "end": 135.734,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For it is expedient that there should be a great and last sacrifice;",
      "verse": "34:10",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 135.914,
      "end": 138.004,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, not a sacrifice of man,",
      "verse": "34:10",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 138.184,
      "end": 141.435,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither of beast, neither of any manner of fowl;",
      "verse": "34:10",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 141.615,
      "end": 144.03,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for it shall not be a human sacrifice;",
      "verse": "34:10",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 144.21,
      "end": 147.461,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but it must be an infinite and eternal sacrifice.",
      "verse": "34:10",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 148.141,
      "end": 151.578,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now there is not any man that can sacrifice his own blood",
      "verse": "34:11",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 151.758,
      "end": 154.452,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which will atone for the sins of another.",
      "verse": "34:11",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 154.632,
      "end": 156.443,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, if a man murdereth,",
      "verse": "34:11",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 156.623,
      "end": 160.756,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold will our law, which is just, take the life of his brother?",
      "verse": "34:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 160.936,
      "end": 162.376,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto you, Nay.",
      "verse": "34:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 163.056,
      "end": 166.678,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But the law requireth the life of him who hath murdered;",
      "verse": "34:12",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 166.858,
      "end": 172.013,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore there can be nothing which is short of an infinite atonement",
      "verse": "34:12",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 172.193,
      "end": 175.351,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which will suffice for the sins of the world.",
      "verse": "34:12",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 176.031,
      "end": 180.675,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, it is expedient that there should be a great and last sacrifice,",
      "verse": "34:13",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 180.855,
      "end": 184.152,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and then shall there be, or it is expedient there should be,",
      "verse": "34:13",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 184.332,
      "end": 186.561,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a stop to the shedding of blood;",
      "verse": "34:13",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 186.741,
      "end": 189.435,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then shall the law of Moses be fulfilled;",
      "verse": "34:13",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 189.615,
      "end": 193.562,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, it shall be all fulfilled, every jot and tittle,",
      "verse": "34:13",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 193.742,
      "end": 195.785,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and none shall have passed away.",
      "verse": "34:13",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 196.465,
      "end": 200.134,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, this is the whole meaning of the law,",
      "verse": "34:14",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 200.314,
      "end": 203.843,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "every whit pointing to that great and last sacrifice;",
      "verse": "34:14",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 204.023,
      "end": 208.11,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that great and last sacrifice will be the Son of God,",
      "verse": "34:14",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 208.29,
      "end": 210.24,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, infinite and eternal.",
      "verse": "34:14",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 210.92,
      "end": 213.474,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus he shall bring salvation",
      "verse": "34:15",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 213.654,
      "end": 216.022,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to all those who shall believe on his name;",
      "verse": "34:15",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 216.202,
      "end": 221.589,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "this being the intent of this last sacrifice, to bring about the bowels of mercy,",
      "verse": "34:15",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 221.769,
      "end": 223.905,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which overpowereth justice,",
      "verse": "34:15",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 224.085,
      "end": 226.314,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and bringeth about means unto men",
      "verse": "34:15",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 226.494,
      "end": 229.28,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may have faith unto repentance.",
      "verse": "34:15",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 229.96,
      "end": 233.257,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus mercy can satisfy the demands of justice,",
      "verse": "34:16",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 233.437,
      "end": 236.131,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and encircles them in the arms of safety,",
      "verse": "34:16",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 236.311,
      "end": 239.469,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "while he that exercises no faith unto repentance",
      "verse": "34:16",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 239.649,
      "end": 242.668,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "is exposed to the whole law of the demands of justice;",
      "verse": "34:16",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 242.848,
      "end": 246.703,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore only unto him that has faith unto repentance",
      "verse": "34:16",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 246.883,
      "end": 250.459,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "is brought about the great and eternal plan of redemption.",
      "verse": "34:16",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 251.139,
      "end": 254.158,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore may God grant unto you, my brethren,",
      "verse": "34:17",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 254.338,
      "end": 257.914,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may begin to exercise your faith unto repentance,",
      "verse": "34:17",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 258.094,
      "end": 260.788,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye begin to call upon his holy name",
      "verse": "34:17",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 260.968,
      "end": 263.151,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he would have mercy upon you;",
      "verse": "34:17",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 263.831,
      "end": 267.221,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, cry unto him for mercy; for he is mighty to save.",
      "verse": "34:18",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 267.901,
      "end": 269.387,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, humble yourselves,",
      "verse": "34:19",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 269.567,
      "end": 271.703,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and continue in prayer unto him.",
      "verse": "34:19",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 272.383,
      "end": 274.937,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Cry unto him when ye are in your fields,",
      "verse": "34:20",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 275.117,
      "end": 276.882,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, over all your flocks.",
      "verse": "34:20",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 277.562,
      "end": 279.605,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Cry unto him in your houses,",
      "verse": "34:21",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 279.785,
      "end": 282.2,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, over all your household,",
      "verse": "34:21",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 282.38,
      "end": 284.33,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both morning, mid-day, and evening.",
      "verse": "34:21",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 285.01,
      "end": 288.261,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, cry unto him against the power of your enemies.",
      "verse": "34:22",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 288.941,
      "end": 293.585,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, cry unto him against the devil, who is an enemy to all righteousness.",
      "verse": "34:23",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 294.265,
      "end": 296.912,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Cry unto him over the crops of your fields,",
      "verse": "34:24",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 297.092,
      "end": 299.042,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may prosper in them.",
      "verse": "34:24",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 299.722,
      "end": 301.905,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Cry over the flocks of your fields,",
      "verse": "34:25",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 302.085,
      "end": 303.85,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may increase.",
      "verse": "34:25",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 304.53,
      "end": 306.109,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But this is not all;",
      "verse": "34:26",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 306.289,
      "end": 308.89,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye must pour out your souls in your closets,",
      "verse": "34:26",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 309.07,
      "end": 310.788,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and your secret places,",
      "verse": "34:26",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 310.968,
      "end": 312.361,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in your wilderness.",
      "verse": "34:26",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 313.041,
      "end": 315.409,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and when you do not cry unto the Lord,",
      "verse": "34:27",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 315.589,
      "end": 320.883,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "let your hearts be full, drawn out in prayer unto him continually for your welfare,",
      "verse": "34:27",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 321.063,
      "end": 324.825,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also for the welfare of those who are around you.",
      "verse": "34:27",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 325.505,
      "end": 327.966,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "34:28",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 328.146,
      "end": 329.632,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto you,",
      "verse": "34:28",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 329.812,
      "end": 332.088,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "do not suppose that this is all;",
      "verse": "34:28",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 332.268,
      "end": 334.776,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for after ye have done all these things,",
      "verse": "34:28",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 334.956,
      "end": 337.696,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if ye turn away the needy, and the naked,",
      "verse": "34:28",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 337.876,
      "end": 340.384,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and visit not the sick and afflicted,",
      "verse": "34:28",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 340.564,
      "end": 342.979,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and impart of your substance, if ye have,",
      "verse": "34:28",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 343.159,
      "end": 344.877,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to those who stand in need\u2014",
      "verse": "34:28",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 345.057,
      "end": 346.543,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto you,",
      "verse": "34:28",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 346.723,
      "end": 348.72,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if ye do not any of these things,",
      "verse": "34:28",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 348.9,
      "end": 352.244,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, your prayer is vain, and availeth you nothing,",
      "verse": "34:28",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 352.424,
      "end": 355.582,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye are as hypocrites who do deny the faith.",
      "verse": "34:28",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 356.262,
      "end": 359.652,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, if ye do not remember to be charitable,",
      "verse": "34:29",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 359.832,
      "end": 363.361,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye are as dross, which the refiners do cast out,",
      "verse": "34:29",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 363.541,
      "end": 365.213,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "(it being of no worth)",
      "verse": "34:29",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 365.393,
      "end": 367.39,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and is trodden under foot of men.",
      "verse": "34:29",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 368.07,
      "end": 370.253,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my brethren, I would that,",
      "verse": "34:30",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 370.433,
      "end": 373.034,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after ye have received so many witnesses,",
      "verse": "34:30",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 373.214,
      "end": 376.465,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "seeing that the holy scriptures testify of these things,",
      "verse": "34:30",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 376.645,
      "end": 379.896,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye come forth and bring fruit unto repentance.",
      "verse": "34:30",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 380.576,
      "end": 385.034,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, I would that ye would come forth and harden not your hearts any longer;",
      "verse": "34:31",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 385.214,
      "end": 388.697,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, now is the time and the day of your salvation;",
      "verse": "34:31",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 388.877,
      "end": 392.546,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and therefore, if ye will repent and harden not your hearts,",
      "verse": "34:31",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 392.726,
      "end": 397.416,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "immediately shall the great plan of redemption be brought about unto you.",
      "verse": "34:31",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 398.096,
      "end": 402.183,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, this life is the time for men to prepare to meet God;",
      "verse": "34:32",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 402.363,
      "end": 407.1,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, behold the day of this life is the day for men to perform their labors.",
      "verse": "34:32",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 407.78,
      "end": 410.241,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, as I said unto you before,",
      "verse": "34:33",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 410.421,
      "end": 419.477,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as ye have had so many witnesses, therefore, I beseech of you that ye do not procrastinate the day of your repentance until the end;",
      "verse": "34:33",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 419.657,
      "end": 421.607,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for after this day of life,",
      "verse": "34:33",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 421.787,
      "end": 424.434,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which is given us to prepare for eternity,",
      "verse": "34:33",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 424.614,
      "end": 427.958,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, if we do not improve our time while in this life,",
      "verse": "34:33",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 428.138,
      "end": 432.921,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then cometh the night of darkness wherein there can be no labor performed.",
      "verse": "34:33",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 433.601,
      "end": 436.991,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Ye cannot say, when ye are brought to that awful crisis,",
      "verse": "34:34",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 437.171,
      "end": 438.704,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I will repent,",
      "verse": "34:34",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 438.884,
      "end": 440.788,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I will return to my God.",
      "verse": "34:34",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 440.968,
      "end": 442.64,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nay, ye cannot say this;",
      "verse": "34:34",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 442.82,
      "end": 446.303,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for that same spirit which doth possess your bodies",
      "verse": "34:34",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 446.483,
      "end": 449.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "at the time that ye go out of this life,",
      "verse": "34:34",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 449.264,
      "end": 454.233,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that same spirit will have power to possess your body in that eternal world.",
      "verse": "34:34",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 454.913,
      "end": 460.114,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, if ye have procrastinated the day of your repentance even until death,",
      "verse": "34:35",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 460.294,
      "end": 463.916,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, ye have become subjected to the spirit of the devil,",
      "verse": "34:35",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 464.096,
      "end": 466.046,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he doth seal you his;",
      "verse": "34:35",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 466.226,
      "end": 469.616,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, the Spirit of the Lord hath withdrawn",
      "verse": "34:35",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 469.796,
      "end": 472.536,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "from you, and hath no place in you,",
      "verse": "34:35",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 472.716,
      "end": 475.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the devil hath all power over you;",
      "verse": "34:35",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 475.264,
      "end": 477.54,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this is the final state of the wicked.",
      "verse": "34:35",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 478.22,
      "end": 479.52,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And this I know,",
      "verse": "34:36",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 479.7,
      "end": 481.418,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because the Lord hath said",
      "verse": "34:36",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 481.598,
      "end": 483.966,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he dwelleth not in unholy temples,",
      "verse": "34:36",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 484.146,
      "end": 487.211,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but in the hearts of the righteous doth he dwell;",
      "verse": "34:36",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 487.391,
      "end": 493.15,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and he has also said that the righteous shall sit down in his kingdom, to go no more out;",
      "verse": "34:36",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 493.33,
      "end": 497.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but their garments should be made white through the blood of the Lamb.",
      "verse": "34:36",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 498.097,
      "end": 500.14,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "34:37",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 500.32,
      "end": 502.967,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I desire that ye should remember these things,",
      "verse": "34:37",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 503.147,
      "end": 507.002,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that ye should work out your salvation with fear before God,",
      "verse": "34:37",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 507.182,
      "end": 510.433,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that ye should no more deny the coming of Christ;",
      "verse": "34:37",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 511.113,
      "end": 514.085,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "That ye contend no more against the Holy Ghost,",
      "verse": "34:38",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 514.265,
      "end": 515.89,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but that ye receive it,",
      "verse": "34:38",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 516.07,
      "end": 518.485,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and take upon you the name of Christ;",
      "verse": "34:38",
      "lineIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "start": 518.665,
      "end": 521.359,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye humble yourselves even to the dust,",
      "verse": "34:38",
      "lineIndex": 158
    },
    {
      "start": 521.539,
      "end": 524.836,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and worship God, in whatsoever place ye may be in,",
      "verse": "34:38",
      "lineIndex": 159
    },
    {
      "start": 525.016,
      "end": 526.966,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in spirit and in truth;",
      "verse": "34:38",
      "lineIndex": 160
    },
    {
      "start": 527.146,
      "end": 529.561,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that ye live in thanksgiving daily,",
      "verse": "34:38",
      "lineIndex": 161
    },
    {
      "start": 529.741,
      "end": 533.549,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the many mercies and blessings which he doth bestow upon you.",
      "verse": "34:38",
      "lineIndex": 162
    },
    {
      "start": 534.229,
      "end": 536.737,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and I also exhort you, my brethren,",
      "verse": "34:39",
      "lineIndex": 163
    },
    {
      "start": 536.917,
      "end": 539.843,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye be watchful unto prayer continually,",
      "verse": "34:39",
      "lineIndex": 164
    },
    {
      "start": 540.023,
      "end": 543.785,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may not be led away by the temptations of the devil,",
      "verse": "34:39",
      "lineIndex": 165
    },
    {
      "start": 543.965,
      "end": 546.194,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he may not overpower you,",
      "verse": "34:39",
      "lineIndex": 166
    },
    {
      "start": 546.374,
      "end": 549.485,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may not become his subjects at the last day;",
      "verse": "34:39",
      "lineIndex": 167
    },
    {
      "start": 549.665,
      "end": 552.266,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, he rewardeth you no good thing.",
      "verse": "34:39",
      "lineIndex": 168
    },
    {
      "start": 552.946,
      "end": 554.989,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "34:40",
      "lineIndex": 169
    },
    {
      "start": 555.169,
      "end": 557.491,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I would exhort you to have patience,",
      "verse": "34:40",
      "lineIndex": 170
    },
    {
      "start": 557.671,
      "end": 560.365,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that ye bear with all manner of afflictions;",
      "verse": "34:40",
      "lineIndex": 171
    },
    {
      "start": 560.545,
      "end": 562.728,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye do not revile against those",
      "verse": "34:40",
      "lineIndex": 172
    },
    {
      "start": 562.908,
      "end": 564.58,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who do cast you out",
      "verse": "34:40",
      "lineIndex": 173
    },
    {
      "start": 564.76,
      "end": 566.943,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because of your exceeding poverty,",
      "verse": "34:40",
      "lineIndex": 174
    },
    {
      "start": 567.123,
      "end": 569.677,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "lest ye become sinners like unto them;",
      "verse": "34:40",
      "lineIndex": 175
    },
    {
      "start": 570.357,
      "end": 572.307,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But that ye have patience,",
      "verse": "34:41",
      "lineIndex": 176
    },
    {
      "start": 572.487,
      "end": 574.623,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and bear with those afflictions,",
      "verse": "34:41",
      "lineIndex": 177
    },
    {
      "start": 574.803,
      "end": 579.772,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "with a firm hope that ye shall one day rest from all your afflictions.",
      "verse": "34:41",
      "lineIndex": 178
    }
  ]
}